          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408810654235-How-to-insert-personalization-into-text-blocks#01FJZ31HT2BSB2NED6B0VHY911",
          "text": "Add tags using the personalization menu"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408810654235-How-to-insert-personalization-into-text-blocks#01FJZ31HT2CF7QA3Q3NVJ05PDN",
          "text": "Add personalization from the preview modal"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408810654235-How-to-insert-personalization-into-text-blocks#01FJZ31HT2ZJZ5K3XN6JEWK7QM",
          "text": "Manually adding personalization"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408810654235-How-to-insert-personalization-into-text-blocks#01FJZ31HT2RFZ13898JS5PFSV2",
          "text": "Setting a default value"
